CM_ "Xbox controller to J1939 bridge (Heltec V2 + RP2040 CAN Feather). 250 kbit/s. On controller loss all axis statuses and buttons report Error (2).";
CM_ BU_ XboxCanBridge "RP2040 CAN Feather, J1939 source address 0x80.";
CM_ BO_ 2365445760 "Basic Joystick Message 1 (PGN 64982): left stick + face/shoulder/system buttons. CAN ID 0x0CFDD680, priority 3, SA 0x80, 20 ms.";
CM_ SG_ 2365445760 LS_X_Position "Magnitude from neutral, 0-100 %. Direction from LS_X_Left / LS_X_Right. Deadband applied: inside it, LS_X_Neutral=On and position=0.";
CM_ SG_ 2365445760 LS_Y_Position "Magnitude from neutral, 0-100 %. Direction from LS_Y_Back / LS_Y_Fwd. Deadband applied: inside it, LS_Y_Neutral=On and position=0.";
CM_ BO_ 2365446272 "Basic Joystick Message 2 (PGN 64984): right stick + D-pad + triggers as buttons. CAN ID 0x0CFDD880, priority 3, SA 0x80, 20 ms.";
CM_ SG_ 2365446272 RS_X_Position "Magnitude from neutral, 0-100 %. Direction from RS_X_Left / RS_X_Right. Deadband applied: inside it, RS_X_Neutral=On and position=0.";
CM_ SG_ 2365446272 RS_Y_Position "Magnitude from neutral, 0-100 %. Direction from RS_Y_Back / RS_Y_Fwd. Deadband applied: inside it, RS_Y_Neutral=On and position=0.";
CM_ BO_ 2365446784 "Basic Joystick Message 3 (PGN 64986): X = left trigger, Y = right trigger (positive direction only). CAN ID 0x0CFDDA80, priority 3, SA 0x80, 20 ms.";

